[node name="RichTextLabel" type="RichTextLabel" parent="MonsterTabHolder/DragonBox/ScrollContainer/MarginContainer" unique_id=1711435970]
layout_mode = 2
theme = ExtResource("3_k1sou")
bbcode_enabled = true
text = "[b] Dragon:[/b]
Dragons are born at the top of the hierarchy of all living things and stay there for the rest of their long lives, 
They look down upon other races and rightfully so with their great intellect and strength and extremely fine tuned mana control theres nothing that can match their strength besides their own kin,
The body of a dragon is infused so deeply with magic that even being near a dragon corpse has miraculous effects


[b]Variants:[/b]
The color of a dragon's scales holds more meaning than you would think.."
metadata/_edit_lock_ = true

